[Thinking]
The user wants a complete HTML page for a CS:GO (Counter-Strike: Global Offensive) website. I should create a comprehensive, visually appealing, and modern website that covers CS:GO (now CS2) themes. Let me build a full-featured single-page website with:

1. Navigation bar
2. Hero section
3. Features/game modes section
4. Weapons/ar section
5. Maps section
6. Stats section
7. News/updates section
8. Footer

I'll use modern CSS with a dark gaming theme, gradients, animations, and make it look professional. CS:GO's color scheme is primarily dark with orange/yellow accents. Let me create something impressive and complete.
[/Thinking]

